@FairPlay.Sports.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5228

### Get all users
GET {{FairPlay.Sports.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users
Accept: application/json

### Get a user by id (replace {{id}} with a real id from the list above)
@id = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{FairPlay.Sports.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{id}}
Accept: application/json

### Register a new user
POST {{FairPlay.Sports.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "carlos",
  "email": "carlos@example.com",
  "password": "Sup3rSecret!",
  "team": "FairPlay FC"
}

###
